---
description: Motion library (motion.dev) — the successor to Framer Motion for React
globs: ["*.tsx", "*.ts"]
---

- Import from `motion`: `motion`, `AnimatePresence`, `useSpring`, etc.
- Motion is the active development fork of Framer Motion. Prefer `motion` over `framer-motion` for new code.
- Same API surface as Framer Motion: variants, gestures, layout, springs.
- `useSpring` for interpolating values with spring physics (mouse tracking, scroll-driven).
- Springs: prefer `{ type: "spring", duration: 0.5, bounce: 0.2 }`.
- CSS `@starting-style` can replace the mounted-state pattern for simple entrances.
